  <div class="section-heading">Recommended immediate actions</div>
  <p>Recommended security practices and firewall configurations can help protect the AC 800PEC controller from attacks that originate from outside the network.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Use the AC 800PEC within a secure network</li>
    <li>Add a firewall in the network. Administrators can add a rule to drop/block any TCP-segment where URG-flag is set.</li>
  </ul>

